    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city is one of Orange County’s youngest, officially incorporated in 1992 as a master‑planned community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rancho_Santa_Margarita%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "It sits atop Plano Trabuco, a high plateau that gives the town its distinctive rolling hills and panoramic views.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rancho_Santa_Margarita%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Spanish explorers first settled the area in the late 1700s, founding Mission San Juan Capistrano in 1776 before California became part of Mexico.",
